WEBVTT

00:00:03.258 --> 00:00:05.645
Widgets is a feature of its own.

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:08.660
Under Tools, Features, search for Widgets.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:15.068
Its description says it provides a part allowing content items to render widgets in theme zones.

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:19.197
The row offers Disable because the feature is enabled.

00:00:19.197 --> 00:00:22.978
On a site where it is turned off, the button reads Enable.

00:00:22.978 --> 00:00:26.522
The Blog recipe, which sets up this site, turns it on.

